          "text": "A small injection budget already moves target rankings in sequential recommenders.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "The primary objective of poisoning attacks is to promote a chosen item by manipulating the training data that the recommender learns from.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lovelace and colleagues demonstrate that injecting only 0.5% synthetic profiles raises the target item's hit rate from 0.7% to 14.2% on MovieLens-1M.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "This twenty-fold increase shows that even a minimal injection budget can substantially alter the visibility of a target item.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attack works by crafting user profiles that interact with the target item in a way that biases the sequential model's learned representations.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because sequential recommenders rely on order and co-occurrence patterns, a few strategically placed interactions can have an outsized effect on ranking.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "The cost to the attacker is low, as the injected profiles need not be realistic or diverse; they only need to align with the model's training objective.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus, the attack objective is achievable with a minimal budget, making poisoning a practical threat for sequential recommenders.",
          "cite_keys": ["lovelace2025poison"],
          "evidence_ids": ["e-1"]
        }
      ]
    }
